1
00:00:05,304 --> 00:00:10,054
(Sheldon:)Electrons move through graphene,
act as if they have no mass.

2
00:00:11,561 --> 00:00:13,231
(Howard:)How long has he been stuck?

3
00:00:13,396 --> 00:00:15,316
Mm, intellectually, about 30 hours.

4
00:00:15,481 --> 00:00:17,401
(Leonard:)Emotionally, about 29 years.

5
00:00:18,693 --> 00:00:20,983
(Sheldon:)Unit cell contains two carbon atoms.

6
00:00:21,154 --> 00:00:24,284
(Sheldon:)Interior angle of a hexagon
is 120 degrees.

7
00:00:27,368 --> 00:00:29,658
(Howard:)Have you tried rebooting him?

8
00:00:31,414 --> 00:00:33,044
[BOTH LAUGHING]

9
00:00:33,499 --> 00:00:36,379
(Leonard:)No. I think it's a firmware problem.

10
00:00:37,170 --> 00:00:40,710
(Raj(arriving):)Hey, it's disco night
at the Moonlight Roller Rink tonight.

11
00:00:40,882 --> 00:00:43,012
(Raj(arriving):)Who's up for getting down?

12
00:00:43,176 --> 00:00:44,426
(Howard:)Oh, that's perfect.

13
00:00:44,594 --> 00:00:47,304
Bernadette's been hawking me
to take her roller skating.

14
00:00:47,471 --> 00:00:50,141
(Leonard:)Penny likes to skate.
The four of us could double.

15
00:00:50,308 --> 00:00:51,348
(Howard:)We're in.

16
00:00:51,517 --> 00:00:55,107
(Raj:)Great. It's not like I brought it up
because I wanted to go.

17
00:00:58,191 --> 00:01:00,651
(Howard:)-You can come with us.
-No. I don't have to go.

18
00:01:00,818 --> 00:01:04,108
(Raj:)I'm happy just to guide you
to suitable entertainment choices.

